+  "title": "Keryx conditional reference declarations",
+  "description": ".metaproject/rules/project/references.json. See README.md section 5.1. Each entry declares a document that project rules cite, where it applies (file globs and task keywords), the section that matters (anchor) and what it governs. A path must be relative and stay inside the project root; JSON Schema cannot express that normalisation, so the loader (src/gdskills/references-config.ts) also rejects a path that escapes the root. Each document is declared once: two entries whose normalised paths are equal make the file invalid, which JSON Schema cannot express either.",
+  "type": "object",
